Package: mazegenerator
Title: Generate, Visualize, and Solve Random Mazes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matheus", email = "mat.fmc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An educational implementation of the randomized depth-first search
    algorithm with backtracking. Generate perfect rectangular mazes, visualize
    their construction, export animated GIFs, and find paths with A-star search.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/matfmc/mazegenerator,
    https://matfmc.github.io/mazegenerator/
BugReports: https://github.com/matfmc/mazegenerator/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    magick,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
